menu "TouchDeck UI"

    config TD_UI_SKIP_NOOP_SETS
        bool "Skip unchanged label sets in widget and dashboard redraws"
        default y
        help
            When an app sends a widget or dashboard value, the redraw sets every label's text, and a widget's text
            opacity, even when nothing changed, and each such set redraws the label. With this on, a set runs only
            when the label would change. The screen shows the same pixels either way, with fewer redrawn frames. Off,
            every set runs.

endmenu
